# Checkout

Taking payment for an order.

## K-001 — A card the bank declines

| Step | Statement |
| --- | --- |
| Given | an order awaiting payment |
| Given | a card the bank will decline |
| When | checkout runs |
| Then | the order is left awaiting payment |
